Package: documenteR
Title: Collect, Document and Export Analysis Outputs
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jiri", "Munich", , "jiri.munich@paqresearch.cz",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("PAQ Research", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: A lightweight framework for marking analysis outputs (data,
    plots, tables and in-text statistics) as they are produced, documenting
    them inline, and exporting everything at once into a versioned,
    self-describing folder structure. Each export carries README files, a
    machine-readable manifest, a data codebook, a typeset PDF plot
    catalogue and a full run log, so results can be handed over or
    reproduced without additional work.
